  "title": "Savory Stuffed Butternut Squash",
  "description": "This flavor-packed stuffed butternut squash with farro, cranberries, kale, and goat cheese makes an impressive vegetarian main dish for your holiday meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole McLaughlin"
  ],
